  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「るんたった～♪　るんたった～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「ついにっ、今日は楽しい『新入生懇親会』の初日かなって！　めいっぱい楽しんじゃうよぉ、えいえいお～う☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「みんなで、がんばって準備したもんね！　大成功させたいかなって！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「どんどんビラ配っちゃうよぉ、どうぞどうぞ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「こんにちは～っ、一年Ａ組では『猫耳メイド喫茶』をやってます！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「かわいい猫耳メイドさんたちが、にゃんにゃんご奉仕しちゃいま～す☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「本物の猫ちゃんもいるので、にゃんこが大好きなかたは是非とも遊びにきちゃってくださ～い！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「大歓迎かなって♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（しかしまぁ、お客さんいっぱい！　人混みで息が詰まっちゃうなぁ、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（ビラ配りとかする必要もなく『猫耳メイド喫茶』も大入りになっちゃうかなって？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（保護者のかたに在校生、学校の先生にくわえてＯＢとかＯＧとかの卒業生……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（あと近所のひとも気軽に立ち寄ってＯＫ、みたいな感じっぽい？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（わたしたちが一年生だったころは、めちゃくちゃ警備とか厳しくて『ぴりぴり』してたけど……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（よかった、今年はゆる～い雰囲気かなって♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（でも『懇親会』は一年生だけの文化祭、みたいな感じなのに～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（一年生だけでこれなら、全校が出し物とかするほんとの文化祭は大変なことになっちゃうかも？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（そっちでは、わたしたち演劇部も舞台やるしね！　演劇部の晴れ舞台だもんねっ、『わくわく』しちゃうよぉ♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（今から気合いれてくよぉ、今年は新入部員すくなかったから人手を集めないと……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（やこちゃんも、文化祭までには帰ってきてくれたらいいなぁ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（まぁ、いないひとに頼っても仕方ないかなって。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（やこちゃん、もともと演劇に興味なかったっぽいし……。わたしに付きあって、入部してくれたんだもんね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（本人に言ったら、絶対に否定するどころかキレると思うけど……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（絶対に言わないでおこう、心のメモ帳に書き残しておこうかなって）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（むかぁし、中学生だったころ……。わたしは、存在しないみたいだった。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（空気みたいに、ここにいるのに『いない』みたいに無視されてた）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（かわいこぶりっこして、うざがられて……。でも演劇なら、かわいい演技をしても。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（むしろ注目される、見てもらえるから）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（最高の演技をすれば、誰にもわたしを無視できない。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（独りぼっちだった、何者でもなかったわたしは、お姫さまにも何にでもなれるの）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（そうでしょ、やこちゃん。あのころ、唯一、わたしを見つけてくれたやこちゃんは……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（他のみんなの視線を、わたしに向けてくれようとしたんだよね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（だから、演劇部だったんだ。わたしの背中を押して、無理やり入部届を書かせて……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（寄り添って、文句ばっかり言いながら。でも、ずうっと一緒にいてくれたよね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（いつも気づくの遅いんだ、わたし。ありがとうって言いたくても、そばにいない……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（やこちゃん、あなたは今どこにいるの？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（わたしはね、幸せな、賑やかな、青春のなかにいるよ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "（中学生だったころ、ずうっと憧れてた舞台に立ってるよ。やこちゃんが、つれてきてくれたんだよ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-neko-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-neko-maid_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
